('7d18484e-d1f9-5c03-87c7-c2d525f1624b', '9138d34c-efd7-5f28-a487-c636661ebf81', 'It makes the equations neater: x = x₀ sin ωt instead of x = x₀ sin 2πft', 'C', true, 2),
